.text}\n994|          </p>\n995|        </article>\n996|      ))}\n997|    </div>\n998|  );\n999|}\n1000|\n1001|const WEEK = [62, 95, 71, 118, 104, 84, 84];\n1002|\n1003|function WeekChart() {\n1004|  const max = Math.max(...WEEK);\n1005|  return (\n1006|    <span className=\"week\" aria-hidden>\n1007|      {WEEK.map((m, i) => (\n1008|        <span key={i} className={i === WEEK.length - 1 ? \"wk today\" : \"wk\"} style={{ height: `${(m / max) * 100}%` }} />\n1009|      ))}\n1010|    </span>\n1011|  );\n1012|}","final_result":true}}}
